	(text "U2: OE LOW = ENABLED; OE HIGH = HIGH IMPEDANCE\nR23 20k PULLDOWN RETAINED; B4 INTENTIONAL NC\nU8: 25MHz / 1V2_0; EN TIED HIGH. EXACT ORDER CODE QUALIFICATION HOLD.\nU10 / U11 PIN 4: TRUE NC / INTENTIONAL_NC."
